{
  "title": "Aromatic Floral Spanish Shrimp Gambas Al Ajillo",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Spanish dish featuring quinoa and shrimp in a flavorful garlic sauce, infused with floral notes and made FODMAP-friendly with kombu-cold-extract.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
